theme_override_constants/margin_right = 96
; ⚠️ 96, NOT 44, AND IT IS A REPORTED BUG RATHER THAN A TASTE CALL. 🧑 2026-08-01:
; *"a reoccuring bug, in fullscreen back button is cut off in lobby and other
; places so can u pls raise it a bit up"*. This column is a VBox that pushes
; BackButton to its bottom edge, so this margin IS the button's clearance — and at
; 44 it was the tightest bottom margin on any screen in the project (BACK ends
; ~154 px clear on MultiplayerSetup, ~141 on CharacterSelect, ~104 on Tutorial).
; `match_setup.gd::_refresh_detail` already documents an earlier, worse version of
; the same bug — four concatenated paragraphs left "seventeen pixels of margin" and
; pushed BACK off the bottom entirely. That fix removed the VARIABLE height; this
; one removes the remaining fixed tightness, which is what survived it. 96 matches
; margin_right, so the frame is symmetric rather than arbitrary.
theme_override_constants/margin_bottom = 96

